flowchart LR
  PR[Pull Request] --> L[Lint + Typecheck]
  L --> T[Unit + Component Tests]
  T --> B[Production Build]
  B --> S[Security + Bundle Checks]
  S --> E[E2E + Accessibility]
  E --> P[Preview Environment]
  P --> M[Merge]
  M --> D[Progressive Deployment]
  D --> O[Monitoring + Rollback]
